{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_01",
  "title": "源石虫农家乐",
  "storyCode": "DT-1",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "61f187b7f9891479e3d1ce4d01b3807cbb7469fb635f29e01f8525f8b8c6790f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哥......快逃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_white"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_white"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "法琳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，是梦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你总算醒了，莱欧斯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你精神怎么样，有觉得头晕吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "头倒是不怎么晕......但突然感觉有点饿了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里是......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "38_g20_skyblue_R2"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天空，太阳，树林......还有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里看起来很像是迷宫的外面，但不论是我、森西还是齐尔查克，都觉得这里不是任何我们见过的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且你看，还是没有反应......我都试了好几次了，微小精灵一点都不回应我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "真是少见......\n森西？你在干什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老夫在调查这里的土质。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们看，这里的土壤湿润、色深，在掌心揉搓变热之后有臭味，说明里面含有大量腐殖质......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是说，非常适合种植！和魔像背上的土质非常相像！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没问你这个！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玛露西尔！你把鸟都吓到了，我差点被它撞下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我这有一个好消息和一个坏消息。首先，我们在周围查看了一圈，都没有见到什么魔物，这附近应该相当安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好消息是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有魔物不就是好消息吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "坏消息呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "坏消息是，这个空间非常宽广，而且周围的环境和我知道的完全不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我从上面看到，这里甚至只是森林的边缘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从一层到五层，老夫从来没见过，也从来没听说过有人发现过这样的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......也就是说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是说......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯小队",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们可能是误打误撞来到了迷宫不为人知的新区域？！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天上飞过去的鸟都是从来没见过的品种，很奇怪，与其说是另一个区域，这里甚至更像是另一个空间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里有没有可能就像是......活画里那样？我们被带到了一个像画中世界一样的新地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是说，我们会遇到未知的魔物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说不定还能试试它们的味道？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在说什么胡话！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们的目的是赶紧去救法琳，现在可不是能在未知区域浪费时间的时候！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且有一件事很重要，我刚刚尝试了很多次，但在这里我只能使用一些简单的魔法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这确实是一个很严肃的问题......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且这片森林和土地很奇怪，很像是为了让植被在这里生长，专门有人开垦出来的一片区域，老夫很清楚这样的手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你根本没有在意我的魔法变弱了这件事吧！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样说的话，我刚才其实还发现森林外面有座有点奇怪的木屋，里面可能会有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们先去那边问问看吧，说不定能问到些什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也把话题扯开了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有点奇怪的木屋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就先去看看好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "54_g1_bobfarm"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到了这么陌生的环境，我们得多加小心啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没人知道这个木屋里是什么，万一是某种新的有敌意的亚人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我建议让我先......\n喂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "54_g1_bobfarm"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "木屋不大，但是被人围上了不少栅栏。栅栏的每根木桩都很牢固，深深地插在地里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "栅栏的高度不高，一般人能轻松翻越，明显不是为了防止人进入，更像是为了阻止生物从地下挖洞逃走而设置的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "地上到处都是黑色的石头，这些是用来做标记的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！你们不要到处乱跑啊！要是遇到了危险怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（低声）剑助？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（剑助会对附近的魔物有反应，难道说......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就说不要到处乱跑了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——哇啊啊啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它、它会动！石头下面，有、有软软的东西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这、这是把石头当成自己甲壳的虫类魔物吗？这层硬壳既是保护手段，也是攻击手段？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你这家伙就在一边看着吗！能不能快点搞定它！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种坚硬的外壳已经保护到了它最柔弱的腹部，通常会有大量神经的脖颈也覆盖了毫无缝隙的外壳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "单凭我们的武器可能很难一下子把它杀死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玛露西尔，用你的魔法！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用小一点的魔法，不要破坏这里的生态环境！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我现在也放不出更大的魔法了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，也就是走路菇的水准。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果然是新型的魔物！玛露西尔你没事吧？被它攻击的感觉如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没事，感谢你的关心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......壳很硬，没想到这种生物竟然覆盖着这样的矿质外壳，真少见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那、那别的部分呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（用斧子把源石虫翻过来）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克&玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是什么样的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别靠这么近！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种未知的生物，千万不要直接碰触。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种伏地生活的动物，多半靠食用腐殖质维生，一般都会携带很多病菌和寄生虫，直接上手触摸的话说不定会被感染。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "确实......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嗯？......剑助？我们不都已经发现这些虫子了吗？难道还有什么危险......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......等等！这附近的石头全都“活”过来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然如此，只能试着一起解决掉！"
