    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，哈......这招怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有各种各样的品种！有的还会吐出液体！小心......液体似乎有腐蚀性！"
